# Triaged, time-boxed CVE waivers for the demo's secure image.
# trivy auto-reads this file (repo root = /workspace during Cloud Build).
#
# These are HIGH findings that are either (a) not reachable in this app's usage,
# or (b) awaiting an upstream release compatible with FastAPI. They only matter
# when _SEVERITY includes HIGH; the default gate (CRITICAL) already passes.
# In the real world each line gets an owner + expiry and is reviewed — that's the
# point: exceptions are explicit and auditable, not silent.

# starlette (transitive via fastapi) — DoS / SSRF via features this app doesn't use
# (no StaticFiles, no Range serving, form limits set at the edge).
CVE-2025-62727
CVE-2026-48818
CVE-2026-54283

